  "differences_from_upstream": [
    "spark_transport/nccl/net-sircl maps to net-sircl; spark_transport/transport-core maps to transport-core.",
    "Standalone build, CI, archive tooling, documentation and synthetic examples retained from public v0.1.0.",
    "External SIRCL/libsircl comparison tests and proxy-adaptation tools remain excluded.",
    "0.1.2 adds the tuner v4 policy, finite request deadlines and sticky transport errors; wire remains 6.",
    "Transport-core exposes version 0.1.1 ABI 1; its startup source identity is derived from the distributed implementation bytes.",
    "Fabric-tool 0.1.2 requires hardware-offloaded relay rules and returns failure for verify blockers.",
    "Corrected PyTorch graph lifetime check, channel and runtime matrices, fault-injection tests and public documentation."
  ],
